{
  "name": "SHIPMATE 03 — Money rail",
  "meta": {
    "description": "Slide 11: demurrage detected -> invoice -> Paytm link -> payment confirmed -> delivery order released. The policy gate is checked BEFORE the link is issued, not after, so an over-threshold amount never reaches the consignee unapproved.",
    "shipmate": {
      "slide": "11 — the money rail",
      "requires": [
        "SHIPMATE_BASE",
        "shipmate-secret credential",
        "PAYTM_MID",
        "paytm-key credential"
      ]
    }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "shipmate/demurrage",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wh-demurrage",
      "name": "Demurrage clock detected",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -580,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Fired by the arrival milestone or by the sentinel. Body: { shipmentRef, consignee, phone, freeDaysExpired, perDayInr, days }"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Line items, with GST applied. Kept in one place so the invoice, the payment link and\n// the ledger entry all quote the same number — three places computing tax separately is\n// how a customer gets billed an amount nobody can reproduce later.\nconst b = $input.first().json.body;\n\nconst perDay = Number(b.perDayInr ?? 4000);\nconst days = Number(b.days ?? 1);\nconst demurrage = perDay * days;\nconst GST_RATE = 0.18;\n\nconst lines = [\n  { description: `Demurrage, ${days} day(s) at INR ${perDay}/day`, amount: demurrage },\n];\n\nconst subtotal = lines.reduce((s, l) => s + l.amount, 0);\nconst gst = Math.round(subtotal * GST_RATE);\nconst total = subtotal + gst;\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  shipmentRef: b.shipmentRef,\n  consignee: b.consignee,\n  phone: b.phone,\n  lines,\n  subtotal,\n  gst,\n  gstRate: GST_RATE,\n  total,\n  currency: 'INR',\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "code-invoice",
      "name": "Build invoice, apply GST",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -360,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SHIPMATE_BASE }}/twins/{{ $json.shipmentRef }}/can",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ action: 'issue_payment_link', amountInr: $json.total }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-can",
      "name": "May we issue this link?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -140,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Two gates in one answer: is issue_payment_link legal in this shipment's current state, and is the amount under the approval threshold. Asked before the money moves, not after.",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "shipmatesecret01",
          "name": "shipmate-secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "version": 2
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "permitted",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.permitted }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-permitted",
      "name": "Permitted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        80,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://securegw.paytm.in/link/create",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  mid: $env.PAYTM_MID,\n  linkType: 'FIXED',\n  linkDescription: 'Demurrage — ' + $('Build invoice, apply GST').item.json.shipmentRef,\n  linkName: $('Build invoice, apply GST').item.json.shipmentRef,\n  amount: { value: String($('Build invoice, apply GST').item.json.total), currency: 'INR' },\n  customerContact: { customerEmail: '', customerMobile: $('Build invoice, apply GST').item.json.phone }\n}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-paytm",
      "name": "Paytm payment link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        220
      ],
      "notes": "Fill PAYTM_MID and the paytm-key credential before enabling. Paytm's link API signs the body with your merchant key — if your account uses checksum signing, add a Code node that computes it and put the result in the head.signature field.",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "paytmkey01",
          "name": "paytm-key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Held for finance\n\nOver the ₹50,000 threshold, or the shipment is not in a state where a payment link is legal.\n\nSHIPMATE has already written a `held` entry to the ledger — it is in `GET /ledger/held`. The desk approves it there; nothing was sent to the consignee.\n\nThis branch exists so \"autonomy with a brake\" is a code path, not a sentence on a slide.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "note-held",
      "name": "Held branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "shipmate/paytm-callback",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wh-paid",
      "name": "Paytm payment callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -580,
        700
      ],
      "webhookId": "shipmate-paytm-callback",
      "notes": "VERIFY THE CHECKSUM before trusting this. Anyone can POST to a webhook URL, and this one releases cargo. Add a Code node that validates Paytm's checksumhash against your merchant key and drops anything that fails."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "version": 2
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "success",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.STATUS }}",
              "rightValue": "TXN_SUCCESS"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-paid",
      "name": "Actually paid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -360,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SHIPMATE_BASE }}/twins/{{ $json.body.ORDERID }}/can",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"action\": \"release_do\"}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-can-do",
      "name": "May we release the DO?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -140,
        700
      ],
      "notes": "It will say no — release_do is on the ALWAYS_APPROVED list in policy.ts. Payment clearing is automatic; handing over the cargo is not. That is the intended answer, and the branch below routes it to the desk.",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "shipmatesecret01",
          "name": "shipmate-secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ received: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-paid",
      "name": "200",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        80,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ received: true, held: !$('May we issue this link?').item.json.permitted }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-demurrage",
      "name": "200 to caller",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Demurrage clock detected": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build invoice, apply GST",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build invoice, apply GST": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "May we issue this link?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "May we issue this link?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Permitted?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Permitted?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Paytm payment link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "200 to caller",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Paytm payment link": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "200 to caller",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Paytm payment callback": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Actually paid?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Actually paid?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "May we release the DO?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "200",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "May we release the DO?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "200",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
